# API structure

Read `api/.cursor/plans/api-identity.md` before Stage 1 API work. Follow the slice order. Do not start a later slice until the previous slice's checks exist.

Organize code by feature under `com.coachingcenter.api`: `common`, `auth`, `users`. Keep each feature's controller, service, repository, and DTOs inside that feature. Do not add a global `controllers`, `services`, or `repositories` package.

Schema changes go through Flyway only. Keep `ddl-auto=validate`.

Every error body has `code`, `message`, optional `fieldErrors`, `timestamp`, and `requestId`. One `code` names one condition. List endpoints use `page` and `size` and one shared page envelope.

All paths are under `/api/v1`. Do not log secrets, passwords, tokens, or one-time codes.
